# X950 / Pixhawk 6X (PX4 v1.17.0 + pps_capture build) — maiden-flight parameter set, 2026-10-01
# QGroundControl "Parameters > Tools > Load from file" format: vehicle<TAB>component<TAB>name<TAB>value<TAB>type (6 = INT32, 9 = FLOAT)
# Section 1: applied to the FC on 2026-10-01 and saved (verified after reboot).
1	1	CA_R_REV	0	6
1	1	COM_LOW_BAT_ACT	3	6
1	1	GF_ACTION	3	6
1	1	GF_MAX_HOR_DIST	50	9
1	1	GF_MAX_VER_DIST	30	9
