# Section 1b: applied 2026-10-02 (UTC), owner-approved. Six mode buttons on ch 5: Stabilized, Altitude, Position,
# Position Slow, Land, Return. RC input: RC wins whenever valid, MAVLink joystick only as a fallback.
1	1	COM_FLTMODE1	8	6
1	1	COM_FLTMODE2	1	6
1	1	COM_FLTMODE3	2	6
1	1	COM_FLTMODE4	9	6
1	1	COM_FLTMODE5	11	6
1	1	COM_FLTMODE6	5	6
1	1	COM_RC_IN_MODE	5	6
# Section 2: proposed, NOT applied — pilot/owner decisions (uncomment to import).
# CAN-only motor path: the AUX pins currently emit DShot600 (PWM_AUX_TIM0=-3) into the A1C PWM inputs, which do not decode it,
# and the resulting DShot esc_status instance 0 is what COM_ARM_CHK_ESCS evaluates instead of the UAVCAN telemetry.
#1	1	PWM_AUX_FUNC1	0	6
#1	1	PWM_AUX_FUNC2	0	6
#1	1	PWM_AUX_FUNC3	0	6
#1	1	PWM_AUX_FUNC4	0	6
#1	1	PWM_AUX_TIM0	400	6
#1	1	DSHOT_BIDIR_EN	0	6
# RC-flown maiden: no automatic action on GCS link loss (RC loss still → NAV_RCL_ACT=2 Return).
#1	1	NAV_DLL_ACT	0	6
# Optical flow off until the H-Flow axis orientation has been validated in motion.
#1	1	EKF2_OF_CTRL	0	6
# Generic GPS driver configured for the same port as the Septentrio driver (it loses the race today).
#1	1	GPS_1_CONFIG	0	6
